      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "ROSS.\nYour son, my lord, has paid a soldier’s debt:\nHe only liv’d but till he was a man;\nThe which no sooner had his prowess confirm’d\nIn the unshrinking station where he fought,\nBut like a man he died.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
